    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To extract fields from a receipt, I can use the Amazon Textract service, which is a machine learning service that automatically extracts text, handwriting, and data from scanned documents. I will write a Python script that uses the Boto3 library to interact with Amazon Textract. The script will be identifiable as using Amazon Textract by importing the Boto3 library and specifying the 'textract' service. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789860201152,
          "start": 1789860197883
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bbfb35fb001Ws2tB0Ot54OyR2",
