    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To extract fields from an invoice, I will use Amazon Textract, a service that automatically extracts text and data from scanned documents. I will write a Python script that uses the Boto3 library to interact with Amazon Textract. The script will identify the provider by importing the Boto3 library and using the Textract client. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789860194512,
          "start": 1789860189909
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bbfb16d5001aBHPnUUcP3iH0w",
